{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22827","headline":"江楼宴别 · 白居易","name":"江楼宴别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楼中别曲催离酌，灯下红裙间绿袍。\n缥缈楚风罗绮薄，铮鏦越调管弦高。\n寒流带月澄如镜，夕吹和霜利似刀。\n尊酒未空欢未尽，舞腰歌袖莫辞劳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22827.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22827","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}